5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I believe we should base our decision on actual usage patterns and the current state of the room. I'll look into the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree that we need a clear picture. I would like to look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see where the time is actually going. I'll check the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the round trip for a hot lunch.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're all being so diligent, I'll handle the financial side. I'll look into the quotes for the two fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire by the hour. Let's see what we're actually paying for.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to seek the truth in details. I shall look into the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks to understand our environment.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we have already selected our areas of investigation, I see no need for further discussion in this turn. I will wait for the results.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us allow the facts to emerge before we attempt to find a solution together. I am content to wait.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'm with you both. Let's just get the data and see who's actually doing the heavy lifting around here. I'm curious to see if the numbers match the stories.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'm equally curious. It's always amusing to see the gap between how people think they use a space and how they actually do. I'll be waiting for the numbers.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,Patience is a virtue that allows the truth to reveal itself. I shall wait in quiet anticipation for the knowledge we are about to gather.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
